msgstr "顯示地圖"

msgid "The map comes from Google Maps; showing it sends your IP address to Google."
msgstr "地圖由 Google 地圖提供；顯示地圖時，您的 IP 位址會傳送給 Google。"

msgid "Open in Google Maps"
msgstr "在 Google 地圖中開啟"

